// Tensor symmetry declarations
// symmetric(tensor, [index_positions])
// antisymmetric(tensor, [index_positions])
// riemann_symmetry(tensor)
// tableau_symmetry(tensor, [shape], [slot_positions]) lowers to the
// structured internal tensor-symmetry model with a single tableau attachment.
// tableau_symmetry([[2,1],[1]], slots=[[0,1,2],[0,1]], labels=["main","aux"], trace_free=[true,false])
// lowers to the same structured model with one attachment per shape/slot entry.
// Example:
// symmetric(g, [0, 1])         — metric is symmetric
// antisymmetric(F, [0, 1])     — field strength is antisymmetric
